  message: "P4 REVIEW 2026-11-01 (dev 9ae4abe13f; owner-requested re-check of open P4 items last modified before 2026-10-20; fixtures under ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/p4_review_11012026/tool1/). VERDICT: CURRENT. Reviewed 2026-11-01 at dev 9ae4abe13f. ls ~/hypergumbo/.agent counts 131 .transcript-injection-state.*.lock files (was 104 on 2026-07-29), all zero-byte, dated 2026-04-24 to 2026-11-01. rotate-on-session-end.sh step 4 (lines 163-166) and launch-transcript-sync.sh orphan sweep (lines 206-209) still rm the .pid/-sync-state/-poll-state/-injection-state.json only; both files changed in 6c70e8c5d9 (2026-09-05), which did not add the .lock. Premise holds; the count in the title is stale. MECHANISM: session-end rotation (step 4) and the orphan sweep each remove four per-session state files but omit the injection-state .lock created by on_transcript_change.py:1055. SHARES MECHANISM WITH: WI-nubik."  # 2570
